<title>ITALY: July bank bad debts up 15.4 pct yr/yr -Bank Italy.</title>
<headline>July bank bad debts up 15.4 pct yr/yr -Bank Italy.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian bank bad debts rose 15.4 percent in July compared with a year earlier, but were a little better than June's 15.8 percent, the Bank of Italy said.</p>
<p>It said July bad debts amounted to 117.83 trillion lire against 102.13 trillion a year earlier and 116.76 trillion in June.</p>
<p>Milan newsroom +392 6612 2321</p>
</text>
